{% set locationThingsPlanningOnly = true %}
{% include "_includes/location-generator-things.njk" %}

{% llmparse('location_things_plan') as locationThingsPlan %}

{% if locationThingsPlan is defined and locationThingsPlan.length == 0 %}
{% llmresult('location_things_catalogue_result') %}
{% else %}
The roster has been validated. The game has already resolved reusable catalogue entries. Expand only these remaining approved entries, keeping every name, item/scenery kind, and rarity unchanged. Do not add, omit, duplicate, combine, or rename entries. Expand the one-sentence descriptions into full descriptions and supply all required mechanics and registered fields. The original location-wide count and rarity minimums will be checked after catalogue entries are combined; do not regenerate catalogue entries.
<approvedThingsPlan>
{% for entry in locationThingsPlan %}<item><name>{{ entry.name | escape }}</name><itemOrScenery>{{ entry.itemOrScenery | escape }}</itemOrScenery><rarity>{{ entry.rarity | escape }}</rarity><description>{{ entry.description | escape }}</description></item>
{% endfor %}</approvedThingsPlan>

{% set locationThingsPlanningOnly = false %}
{% set locationThingsExpansion = true %}
{% include "_includes/location-generator-things.njk" %}
{% endif %}
